        {
          "text": "Neetae Yosef, oishoo lkipaareta enkarna aajo Barnabas (kejo ina oloitagol ilkulikae oishuaa) naa oloo Lewi, laa ole nkop e Kipros, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
